Z||000001||Leadfoot||07-30-2001||11:38 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MD_Fiero:<BR><B>i have a question...i have a 86 fiero 2m4, and i was wondering, since the headlights are one peice, lens and all, i was wondering, if its possible to get a 2 piece headlight, one lens, and then a new bulb, or NO?..any help is appreciated, i will post pics of my car soon..prolly tommorrow.<BR>Thanks A Bunch!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Welcome! I think the fiero store has the kit to convert the headlights to bulbs.  Their site is down right now so I am not certain.  I even think you can get different color bulbs.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Leadfoot (edited 07-30-2001).]||||reg||1
